{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":434,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1907916,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285452,"Name":"september","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1448637943,"LastPoster":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1907916,"PostDate":1448637943,"PostContent":"We are having our wedding in April in Mexico and would like to bring with us homemade 40% liquor...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"xdamiancx@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.13.52.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1448637387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"september","Id":285452,"Name":"september","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.13.52.55","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79765,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f8e9cb9176afe8843c95f32faaa476a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are having our wedding in April in Mexico and would like to bring with us homemade 40% liquor in 750ml bottles with custom labels (it&#039;s a tradition).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;From what I have researched we can have up to 3 liters per checked bag.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Is it okay if we have custom labels on bottles that have been opened before?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907916,"PostDate":1448637943,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are having our wedding in April in Mexico and would like to bring with us homemade 40% liquor in 750ml bottles with custom labels (it's a tradition).<\/p>\n<p>From what I have researched we can have up to 3 liters per checked bag.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Is it okay if we have custom labels on bottles that have been opened before?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"xdamiancx@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.13.52.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1448637387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"september","Id":285452,"Name":"september","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79765,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0400e6f79584fc5e79cf020bd965148","RawContent":"[quote name=\"september\" post=\"1907916\" timestamp=\"1448659543\"]\nWe are having our wedding in April in Mexico and would like to bring with us homemade 40% liquor in 750ml bottles with custom labels (it&#039;s a tradition).\nFrom what I have researched we can have up to 3 liters per checked bag. \nIs it okay if we have custom labels on bottles that have been opened before?[\/quote]@[member=\"september\"] you might want to check with with your TA or your airline. \n\nHappy Planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1907920,"PostDate":1448661439,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>september, on 27 November 2015 - 03:25 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We are having our wedding in April in Mexico and would like to bring with us homemade 40% liquor in 750ml bottles with custom labels (it's a tradition).<\/p>\n<p>From what I have researched we can have up to 3 liters per checked bag.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Is it okay if we have custom labels on bottles that have been opened before?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285452\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285452-september\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">september<\/span><\/a> you might want to check with with your TA or your airline.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326832787,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.87.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79765,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 28 November 2015 - 01:49 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1448718547,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5202e245f362482e5d42cf4eb31ef769","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community september and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding in Mexico!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll find lots of great resources here to help with your planning questions - like Joyce with her great advice about your alcohol question!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sounds like you have a Great tradition with your home made liquor - hope it all works out just the way you hope it will :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;d like to give you a little visual inspiration and share some magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera ....taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/472043_10151179284184487_1208052790_o.jpg\" alt=\"472043_10151179284184487_1208052790_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your research here, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/420455_10151189198454487_1157687673_n.jpg?oh=4f2bce80005581f7dc4370d96453d1e8&amp;amp;oe=56EEC42C\" alt=\"420455_10151189198454487_1157687673_n.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/882948_10151506610509487_1660143585_o.jpg\" alt=\"882948_10151506610509487_1660143585_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907930,"PostDate":1448718442,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community september and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding in Mexico!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll find lots of great resources here to help with your planning questions - like Joyce with her great advice about your alcohol question!<\/p>\n<p>Sounds like you have a Great tradition with your home made liquor - hope it all works out just the way you hope it will <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We'd like to give you a little visual inspiration and share some magical wedding moments that matter we've captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera ....taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/472043_10151179284184487_1208052790_o.jpg\" alt=\"472043_10151179284184487_1208052790_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Enjoy your research here, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/420455_10151189198454487_1157687673_n.jpg?oh=4f2bce80005581f7dc4370d96453d1e8&oe=56EEC42C\" alt=\"420455_10151189198454487_1157687673_n.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/882948_10151506610509487_1660143585_o.jpg\" alt=\"882948_10151506610509487_1660143585_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280189060,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79765","Title":"Flying To Mexico With Homemade Alcohol?","LastPostDate":1448718442},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
