Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1008,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1907696,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285228,"Name":"Vjohana","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1447923147,"LastPoster":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1907696,"PostDate":1447923147,"PostContent":"Hi Everyone, \u00a0 I am a newbie and I am completely overwhelmed during my search for a resort. I do...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vrichani@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.208.70.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446495197,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Vjohana","Id":285228,"Name":"Vjohana","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.242.17.69","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79751,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fda665e3a80c46992934f22e20412fcb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am a newbie and I am completely overwhelmed during my search for a resort. I do not know where to begin! Right now I am looking at getting married either in May or August 2016 with approximately &amp;nbsp;35-50 guests. &amp;nbsp;I am looking at places in Mexico (still trying to decide where).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;While looking at wedding packages online, I wanted to know what are some additional costs that you can expect?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I always thought that packages included everything you need (I REALLY WISH!) but I am slowly beginning to notice that some really important items are missing from packages such as photography, videography, DJ, and reception! For those experienced brides, how much did you incur in additional expenses?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is worth working with a complimentary wedding package and then working to upgrade or input extra costs towards all the extras?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907696,"PostDate":1447923147,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am a newbie and I am completely overwhelmed during my search for a resort. I do not know where to begin! Right now I am looking at getting married either in May or August 2016 with approximately \u00a035-50 guests. \u00a0I am looking at places in Mexico (still trying to decide where).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>While looking at wedding packages online, I wanted to know what are some additional costs that you can expect?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I always thought that packages included everything you need (I REALLY WISH!) but I am slowly beginning to notice that some really important items are missing from packages such as photography, videography, DJ, and reception! For those experienced brides, how much did you incur in additional expenses?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is worth working with a complimentary wedding package and then working to upgrade or input extra costs towards all the extras?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vrichani@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.208.70.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446495197,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Vjohana","Id":285228,"Name":"Vjohana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79751,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7c6a438636d3ff603b0aa3d64803e7d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement!! You are right, there are lots of additional costs, which is annoying and they add up fast.   Most of the wedding packages are for the wedding ceremony only.  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve had to budget for hair and makeup, photographer, DJ, private dinner and reception.&amp;nbsp; Any extra decorations will be extra, but I&#039;m not very creative, and I think Mexico is a place that won&#039;t require a ton of decorations. The back drop (ocean, sand, etc) is enough for me :)\n\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907709,"PostDate":1447934544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your engagement!! You are right, there are lots of additional costs, which is annoying and they add up fast.\u00a0\u00a0 Most of the wedding packages are for the wedding ceremony only.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've had to budget for hair and makeup, photographer, DJ, private dinner and reception.\u00a0 Any extra decorations will be extra, but I'm not very creative, and I think Mexico is a place that won't require a ton of decorations. The back drop (ocean, sand, etc) is enough for me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424092650,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.80.195.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79751,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d9e44b80652f4fd6900a1ec96c50aa8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Vjohana and Congrats on your destination wedding coming up next year!!! You&#039;ve come to the right place to find loads of answers to your planning questions and help from all the resources you find here - so well done on getting a great start!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and that you enjoy your wonderful journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....to inspire you along your way, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured in our incomparable Mayan Riviera.....enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/12248012_10153740893219487_2804814526822408303_o.jpg\" alt=\"12248012_10153740893219487_2804814526822\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/12109790_10153682859529487_4869403078968401747_o.jpg\" alt=\"12109790_10153682859529487_4869403078968\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11951533_10153610355409487_3502002007315431031_o.jpg\" alt=\"11951533_10153610355409487_3502002007315\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907717,"PostDate":1447959069,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Vjohana and Congrats on your destination wedding coming up next year!!! You've come to the right place to find loads of answers to your planning questions and help from all the resources you find here - so well done on getting a great start!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and that you enjoy your wonderful journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....to inspire you along your way, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we've captured in our incomparable Mayan Riviera.....enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>- taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/12248012_10153740893219487_2804814526822408303_o.jpg\" alt=\"12248012_10153740893219487_2804814526822\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/12109790_10153682859529487_4869403078968401747_o.jpg\" alt=\"12109790_10153682859529487_4869403078968\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11951533_10153610355409487_3502002007315431031_o.jpg\" alt=\"11951533_10153610355409487_3502002007315\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280189060,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79751,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by LasCaletas, 21 November 2015 - 10:54 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1448103269,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aeba3c7ca8d4d971cccf363a72ef344d","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"margin-left:35.4pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Dear Johana!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:35.4pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:35.4pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:35.4pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:35.4pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ee82ee;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Congratulations&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt; on your engagement!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;choose a location for your wedding seems difficult but how about a&amp;nbsp;paradisiac venue like \"Las Caletas\"&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Las Caletas is a truly magical place to exchange your vows and celebrate this special occasion. It is our private beach cove in the south bay of Puerto Vallarta Mexico and is only accessible by sea, giving it the seclusion and ambiance of an island hideaway. It covers an enormous area and features several beaches, a pyramid amphitheater built into the tropical forest and mountain side, various facilities\/buildings (spa, kitchens, eating areas\/restaurants, bars, restrooms, etc.), and several hundred acres of tropical fores&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;t.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We offer 3 different packages.(Professional photo, video, Dj, and many details you can add)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18083]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18066]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79041]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;contac us for more information:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907755,"PostDate":1448103158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"margin-left:35.4pt\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Dear Johana!<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:35.4pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:35.4pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:35.4pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:35.4pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Congratulations<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#696969\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> on your engagement!!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#696969\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">choose a location for your wedding seems difficult but how about a\u00a0paradisiac venue like \"Las Caletas\"<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#696969\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Las Caletas is a truly magical place to exchange your vows and celebrate this special occasion. It is our private beach cove in the south bay of Puerto Vallarta Mexico and is only accessible by sea, giving it the seclusion and ambiance of an island hideaway. It covers an enormous area and features several beaches, a pyramid amphitheater built into the tropical forest and mountain side, various facilities\/buildings (spa, kitchens, eating areas\/restaurants, bars, restrooms, etc.), and several hundred acres of tropical fores<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\">t.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>We offer 3 different packages.(Professional photo, video, Dj, and many details you can add)\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18083-adventure-weddings-ceremony-decorations\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/tn_gallery_258213_18083_4291773.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='White, pink and rustic ceremony'  width='75' height='75'  alt='White, pink and rustic ceremony' id='tn_image_view_81801_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18083-adventure-weddings-ceremony-decorations\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Adventure Weddings\/ Ceremony decorations <\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>16 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18066-wedding-entertainment\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18066\/tn_gallery_258213_18066_1969336.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='Let\u00b4s dance to the color of LOVE#AdventureWeddings#DestinationWeddings#PuertoVallarta'  width='75' height='75'  alt='Let\u00b4s dance to the color of LOVE#AdventureWeddings#DestinationWeddings#PuertoVallarta' id='tn_image_view_81501_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18066-wedding-entertainment\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Wedding Entertainment<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>12 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79041-veil\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_4476.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='veil'  width='200' height='134'  alt='veil' id='sml_image_view_79041' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>contac us for more information:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.adventure...gsvallarta.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343037203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79751,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21dc5f1c234c24bdfbd240ea25f4513b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Vjohana\" post=\"1907696\" timestamp=\"1447944747\"]\nHi Everyone,\n\nI am a newbie and I am completely overwhelmed during my search for a resort. I do not know where to begin! Right now I am looking at getting married either in May or August 2016 with approximately  35-50 guests.  I am looking at places in Mexico (still trying to decide where).\n\nWhile looking at wedding packages online, I wanted to know what are some additional costs that you can expect?\n\nI always thought that packages included everything you need (I REALLY WISH!) but I am slowly beginning to notice that some really important items are missing from packages such as photography, videography, DJ, and reception! For those experienced brides, how much did you incur in additional expenses?\n\nIt is worth working with a complimentary wedding package and then working to upgrade or input extra costs towards all the extras?\n\nThanks so much :)[\/quote][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n@[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285228-vjohana\/\"]Vjohana[\/url] you have a very common question , lets dive into your answer,[\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nMy advise since you want an all inclusive resort, first step identify the things that are a must have for you (such prices point, amenities, family friendly etc). Then get a travel agent.  now you might want look for someone who specializes in destination wedding. the owner of this page is TA. ask them to give you hotels that have more benefits. The number of guests also pay a huge part in your wedding packages.  some hotels will include certain for up 20 guests. [\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nAll inclusive doesn&#039;t mean you get everything, as you have found out, but there a number of hotels that cover food, bar and rentals (chairs and tables)[\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nThe following are not covered in the wedding packages.[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nDJ[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nphotographer[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nFlowers[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nDecor[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nHair and make up[\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nPS: if you hire the above from outside, be aware the hotel will be charging an outside vendor fee.[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n(which differs from hotel to hotel)[\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nHappy Planning![\/font][\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1907762,"PostDate":1448114927,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Vjohana, on 19 November 2015 - 08:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am a newbie and I am completely overwhelmed during my search for a resort. I do not know where to begin! Right now I am looking at getting married either in May or August 2016 with approximately \u00a035-50 guests. \u00a0I am looking at places in Mexico (still trying to decide where).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>While looking at wedding packages online, I wanted to know what are some additional costs that you can expect?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I always thought that packages included everything you need (I REALLY WISH!) but I am slowly beginning to notice that some really important items are missing from packages such as photography, videography, DJ, and reception! For those experienced brides, how much did you incur in additional expenses?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is worth working with a complimentary wedding package and then working to upgrade or input extra costs towards all the extras?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285228-vjohana\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Vjohana<\/a>\u00a0you have a very common question , lets dive into your answer,<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">My advise since you want an all inclusive resort, first step identify the things that are a must have for you (such prices point, amenities, family friendly etc). Then get a travel agent. \u00a0now you might want look for someone who\u00a0specializes\u00a0in destination wedding. the owner of this page is TA. ask them to give you hotels that have more\u00a0benefits. The number of guests also pay a huge part in your wedding packages. \u00a0some hotels will include certain for up 20 guests.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">All inclusive doesn't mean you get everything, as you have found out, but there a number of hotels that cover food, bar and rentals (chairs and tables)<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">The following are not covered in the wedding packages.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">DJ<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">photographer<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Flowers<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Decor<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Hair and make up<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">PS: if you hire the above from outside, be aware the hotel will be charging an outside vendor fee.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">(which differs from hotel to hotel)<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326832787,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79751","Title":"Wedding Packages And Additional Costs","LastPostDate":1448114927},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
